      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.42.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Reuben answered them, saying, Did I not speak to you, saying, Do not sin against the young man; and ye would not hear? therefore behold also his blood is required.",
