        {
          "text": "; for he spoke to them by an interpreter.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.42.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.42.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he turned himself away from them, and wept; and returned to them again, and communed with them, and took from them Simeon, and bound him before their eyes.",
