      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.42.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Joseph commanded to fill their sacks with corn, and to restore every man's money into his sack, and to give them provision for the way: and thus did he to them.",
